    "title": "Probing quantum mechanics with nanoparticle matter-wave interferometry - Dataset and code",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17502163",
    "publication_date": "2025-11-01",
    "description": "<p>This directroy contains the measurement data and the python code required to&nbsp;<br>extract the macroscopicity value for the Vienna Na-cluster interference measurements&nbsp;<br>from April 2025.</p>\n<p>Macroscopicity_April2025.py:&nbsp;<br>Python script to calculate the macroscopicity by Bayesian updating</p>\n<p>talbotlau.py:&nbsp;<br>Python module providing functions required for calculating Talbot-Lau&nbsp;<br>interference patterns, visibilities, etc.</p>\n<p>PowerScans_April2025.py:<br>Python script to analyze the power scans, extract visibilities, and compare with theory</p>\n<p>Na-Cluster/Data_April2025/*:<br>Measurement data and mass spectra</p>",
